covered by this repository's Apache-2.0 license. It is distributed by
GreenSock / Webflow under the GSAP Standard "No Charge" License:

  https://gsap.com/standard-license

That license allows free use on any website, web application or digital
interface, including commercial use. Its "Prohibited Uses" clause excludes
